d errors\n\n**Tests**\n- `confirms a created shipment` - Verifies transition from CREATED to CONFIRMED and persistence via HTTP 200 response\n- `confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds` - Verifies idempotent retry safety; second confirm returns HTTP 200 without error\n- `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with conflict` - Verifies HTTP 409 with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED error code\n- `rejects confirming unknown shipment with not found` - Verifies HTTP 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code\n\n**Verification**\nCommand: `./mvnw test` (from sample-service/)\nResult: BUILD SUCCESS - 17 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors\n\n**Not done**\nNothing. All acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests passing, all required files changed, no prohibited files touched."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3340,"cache_read_input_tokens":26502,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3340},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b183a89-361b-4058-a266-759784cf75d6","uuid":"eb65ae62-48d3-4f6d-af8d-9f3562120a73","timestamp":"2026-09-30T15:04:11.246Z","request_id":"req_011CfZq1EH41BJ4kRea6rZQM"}
